==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
BA 441.PNG|Freeze Rays
BA 402.PNG|Ice Constructs (via Freeze Rays)
FaFBM (65).png|Freeze Ray Propulsion
B10kR (52).png|Freezing Breath
BA 400.PNG|Enhanced Jumping
BA 404.PNG|Bipedalism
</gallery>
Arctiguana is capable of breathing out ice from his mouth, by firing either a long-range freeze ray or an icy wind<ref>''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]''</ref> that encases his targets.<ref name="BA">''[[Ben Again]]''</ref> This ice breathing is cold enough to freeze large bodies of liquid, from water<ref name="B10K" /> to molten lava,<ref>''[[Hot Stretch]]''</ref> and can make an [[Arachnachimp (Classic)|Arachnachimp]]'s webbing brittle enough to shatter easily.<ref name="CT">''[[Collect This]]''</ref> His ice is also very slippery, as demonstrated by [[Freeze Lizard]].<ref name="S23">''[[Store 23]]''</ref>

Arctiguana can use his freeze ray to create structures made of ice.<ref name="BA">''[[Ben Again]]''</ref>

Arctiguana can use his freeze ray as a means of quickly propelling himself short distances through the air (along with anyone holding on to him).<ref>''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref><ref name="S23" />

Arctiguana possesses enhanced strength, enough to push a [[Petrosapien (Classic)|Petrosapien]] off a building, as shown by Freeze Lizard.<ref name="S23" />

Arctiguana possesses enhanced durability, being able to withstand being hit by a Petrosapien's shard projectiles, also demonstrated by Freeze Lizard.<ref name="S23" />

Arctiguana can survive in environments with sub-freezing temperatures.{{Refn|group = OV Brief|name = link}}

Arctiguana can crawl up walls without issue, as demonstrated by Freeze Lizard.<ref name="S23" />

==History==
===Ben 10===
*Arctiguana was unlocked off-screen after '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]'''''.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Spitter Unlocked During Flashbacks.PNG]]|group = DJW|name = unlock1}}{{Refn|[[:File:Underpowered Aliens Proof.png]]|group = MW|name = unlock2}}

===Alien Force=== 
*Arctiguana was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Arctiguana was re-unlocked by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].

===Omniverse===
*In ''[[Hot Stretch]]'', Arctiguana froze the lava created by the [[Kraaho]].
*In ''[[Ben Again]]'', Arctiguana was used by 11-year-old Ben in 16-year-old Ben's body to battle [[Eon]]'s [[Eon's Minions (Omniverse)|minions]] alongside 16-year-old [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Rook Blonko|Rook]]. He then helped 16-year-old Ben as 11-year-old [[Wildvine (Classic)|Wildvine]] battle Eon.
*In ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', [[Albedo|Negative]] Arctiguana gave chase to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]], Rook, and [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] and went [[Ultimate Arctiguana|Ultimate]] once he caught up.
*In ''[[Collect This]]'', Arctiguana fought [[Simian]] and [[Deefus Veeblepister]] only to be defeated by [[Unitaur]].

===[[Original Future Timeline|Original Future]]===
*Arctiguana first appeared in ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', where he froze [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]] in water.
*In ''[[Ken 10]]'', Arctiguana froze [[Mot Snikrep]] before [[Ken Tennyson|Ken]] as [[Buzzshock (Classic)|Buzzshock]] could defeat him.

===[[Ultimate Alien Future Timeline|Ultimate Alien Future]]===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', [[Ultimate Ben]] used Arctiguana's ice breath to defeat [[Eon]]'s [[Eon's Minions (Omniverse)|minions]] in [[Tennyson Tower|his headquarters]].

