==Etymology==
Arctiguana's name is a combination of "arctic", referring to his ice powers, and "iguana", referring to his reptile-like appearance.

==Trivia==
*When naming this alien, [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] suggested "Absolute Zero", but 10-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] found it boring and instead named him "Arctiguana".
*In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Arctiguana speaks with a [[Wikipedia:Jamaica|Jamaican]] accent and a windy sound is heard whenever he speaks.
**Arctiguana's voice is slightly higher when used by a younger version of Ben.<ref name="BA" /><ref name="S23" />
*11-year-old Arctiguana was slated to appear in ''[[Hot Stretch]]'', but was probably excluded for time.{{Refn|[[:File:Young Arctiguana Model.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:11yo Arctiguana cut for time.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
**The design was used in the ''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Ben 10: Omniverse]]'' video game, and was later repurposed for [[Freeze Lizard]]'s design.
*Like [[Buzzshock (Classic)|Buzzshock]], Murk [[Upchuck]], [[Snare-Oh]], and [[Frankenstrike]], Arctiguana appeared in '''Omniverse''', but he did not appear in ''[[A New Dawn]]''.
*In the DS and 3DS versions of ''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (Video Game)|Ben 10: Omniverse]]'' and ''[[Ben 10: Omniverse 2]]'', Arctiguana walks on two legs rather than four.
*Arctiguana's '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' design was made by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]]{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}} and repurposed from one of Perk Upchuck's concept designs{{Refn|group = ca|name = Upchuck}} because he did not want it to go to waste.{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Wanted To Repurpose Arctiguana's Concept.png]]|group = TNP}}
*Although Ben unlocked Arctiguana around the same time as [[Feedback]],{{Refn|group = DJW|name = unlock1}} it was never said which one was unlocked first, as the writers would only directly decide on it based on the needs of a story which touches on such matters.{{Refn|group = MW|name = unlock2}}
*The way Arctiguana uses his ice breath to hover and fly is similar to how [[Wikipedia:Godzilla|Godzilla]] uses his nuclear breath to accomplish the same feat.

